# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:12
translate italian jamie1_777c0e1d:

    # "I see Jamie leaving her house and walking out towards her car. I wave at her."
    "Vedo Jamie uscire di casa e dirigersi verso la sua auto. Le faccio un cenno con la mano."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:15
translate italian jamie1_2848acf3:

    # gnd "Hey there."
    gnd "Ciao."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:17
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_008.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_008.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:18
translate italian jamie1_d7b2148b:

    # gnd "I'm going out for a coffee before class. Want to join me?"
    gnd "Vado a prendere un caffè prima della lezione. Ti va di venire con me?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:19
translate italian jamie1_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:20
translate italian jamie1_d60e5294:

    # gnd "Do you know where Java Lava is?"
    gnd "Sai dove si trova Java Lava?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:21
translate italian jamie1_6ff82333:

    # pc "Yep."
    pc "Sì."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:23
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice "voices/jamie_006.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_006.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:24
translate italian jamie1_55e7809c:

    # gnd "Cool, meet me there."
    gnd "Perfetto, ci vediamo lì."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:26
translate italian jamie1_2d0bcd97:

    # "She smiles and gets into her car before pulling out and heading down the road."
    "Lei sorride e sale in macchina prima di partire e dirigersi lungo la strada."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:29
translate italian jamie1_1da96612:

    # "I get into my car and quickly follow her."
    "Salgo in macchina e la seguo subito."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:30
translate italian jamie1_50a2f2a6:

    # "I wonder why she didn't just want to ride together. It's a little weird since we're coming from pretty much the same place."
    "Mi chiedo perché non abbia voluto semplicemente venire con me. È un po’ strano, visto che veniamo praticamente dallo stesso posto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:32
translate italian jamie1_f376757c:

    # "I pull into the Java Lava parking lot and can smell the scent of the coffee drifting out of the entire building."
    "Entro nel parcheggio di Java Lava e sento il profumo del caffè che si diffonde da tutto l’edificio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:33
translate italian jamie1_01e0166e:

    # "I park next to Jamie, who is still sitting in her car."
    "Parcheggio accanto a Jamie, che è ancora seduta in macchina."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:34
translate italian jamie1_15a1f80d:

    # "She steps out at the same time that I do."
    "Lei scende dall’auto proprio mentre lo faccio io."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:38
translate italian jamie1_32e82c5b:

    # gnd "Hey there, fancy meeting you here."
    gnd "Ehi, che coincidenza incontrarti qui."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:39
translate italian jamie1_c2309d17:

    # pc "It is quite a coincidence. Shall we drink together?"
    pc "È davvero una coincidenza. Beviamo qualcosa insieme?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:40
translate italian jamie1_bb6e9df1:

    # gnd "Yes, I think we should."
    gnd "Sì, penso che dovremmo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:41
translate italian jamie1_bec125c3:

    # "We walk up to the front door together. I hold the door open and the barista greets us as we walk in."
    "Ci avviciniamo insieme alla porta d’ingresso. Tengo la porta aperta e la barista ci saluta mentre entriamo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:45
translate italian jamie1_f6e4b44a:

    # "She looks familiar, but I can't place her. Probably just somebody I've seen around town. It's not a very big place."
    "Mi sembra familiare, ma non riesco a riconoscerla. Probabilmente è solo qualcuno che ho visto in giro per la città. Non è un locale molto grande."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:47
translate italian jamie1_f1d232e2:

    # "Tammy is working again today. I guess she works a lot."
    "Anche oggi c’è Tammy al lavoro. Immagino che lavori molto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:48
translate italian jamie1_e532df5e:

    # "Jamie and I place our orders, and the barista makes them without much small talk."
    "Io e Jamie ordiniamo e la barista ci prepara le bevande senza fare troppe chiacchiere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:49
translate italian jamie1_4b7ec1d8:

    # "Then we take our drinks and sit across from each other at a small table in the dining area."
    "Poi prendiamo le nostre bevande e ci sediamo uno di fronte all’altra a un tavolino nella sala da pranzo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:52
translate italian jamie1_7ca9f991:

    # "Jamie seems unusually shy. We'd never had a problem talking to each other when we were younger, but things are different now."
    "Jamie sembra insolitamente timida. Quando eravamo più giovani non avevamo mai avuto problemi a parlare tra di noi, ma ora le cose sono diverse."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:53
translate italian jamie1_e60beee6:

    # "She simply looks at me, and when I look back, she averts her eyes and smiles."
    "Lei mi guarda semplicemente e, quando ricambio lo sguardo, distoglie gli occhi e sorride."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:54
translate italian jamie1_4d348656:

    # "I don't know what to talk about really."
    "Non so proprio di cosa parlare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:55
translate italian jamie1_3fd979ca:

    # pc "So, you're going to school this semester?"
    pc "Allora, questo semestre vai all’università?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:56
translate italian jamie1_cefd0447:

    # "It seems like an easy question to get us started talking about something."
    "Sembra una domanda facile per rompere il ghiaccio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:58
translate italian jamie1_e7bf7de1:

    # gnd "Yeah, Skyhill."
    gnd "Sì, alla Skyhill."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:59
translate italian jamie1_076d61a1:

    # pc "What's your major?"
    pc "Che corso di studi segui?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:60
translate italian jamie1_a9ffb9a9:

    # gnd "I'm in the teaching program. I'll be starting my in-class assistant position this semester, where I help a teacher for two periods a day."
    gnd "Frequento il corso di formazione per insegnanti. Questo semestre inizierò il mio tirocinio in classe, dove aiuterò un insegnante per due ore al giorno."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:61
translate italian jamie1_53927809:

    # pc "Oh, that's exciting."
    pc "Oh, che bello."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:62
translate italian jamie1_d7ae6789:

    # gnd "Yeah, I'm pretty nervous about it actually."
    gnd "Sì, in realtà sono piuttosto nervosa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:63
translate italian jamie1_5924379f:

    # pc "You shouldn't be. You'll do great, I'm sure."
    pc "Non dovresti esserlo. Andrà alla grande, ne sono sicura."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:64
translate italian jamie1_30b2342d:

    # pc "It doesn't surprise me that you're going to become a teacher."
    pc "Non mi sorprende che tu stia per diventare un'insegnante."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:65
translate italian jamie1_d096758b:

    # pc "You always used to help me with my schoolwork. I don't think I would have passed 8th grade English without your help."
    pc "Mi aiutavi sempre con i compiti. Non credo che avrei superato l'inglese di terza media senza il tuo aiuto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:67
translate italian jamie1_8ab7f6ac:

    # gnd "Oh you definitely wouldn't have. Your essays were horrible."
    gnd "Oh, sicuramente no. I tuoi temi erano orribili."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:68
translate italian jamie1_ba5dd62d:

    # pc "They didn't get much better in high school either, or college."
    pc "Non sono migliorati molto nemmeno al liceo, né all'università."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:70
translate italian jamie1_4bc7c623:

    # gnd "So what are you majoring in?"
    gnd "Allora, che corso di laurea stai seguendo?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:71
translate italian jamie1_8dfe1fc1:

    # pc "Quantum Science, but I'm having to take all my basics this year, since I didn't take them before."
    pc "Scienze quantistiche, ma quest’anno devo seguire tutti i corsi di base, dato che prima non li avevo fatti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:72
translate italian jamie1_e89ebb70:

    # gnd "Oh cool. Quantum Science, like your dad huh?"
    gnd "Oh, figo. Scienze quantistiche, come tuo padre, eh?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:73
translate italian jamie1_73fe1c32:

    # pc "Yeah. Different types, but similar."
    pc "Sì. Di tipo diverso, ma simili."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:74
translate italian jamie1_d6a36df7:

    # gnd "I wouldn't have expected that from you."
    gnd "Non me lo sarei aspettato da te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:75
translate italian jamie1_d98cce84:

    # pc "Why's that?"
    pc "Perché?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:76
translate italian jamie1_6e902e84:

    # gnd "Well, you never seemed like the type to enjoy the science and math stuff. I always thought that you'd end up being a used car salesman or something."
    gnd "Beh, non mi sei mai sembrato il tipo a cui piacciono le materie scientifiche e la matematica. Ho sempre pensato che saresti finito a fare il venditore di auto usate o qualcosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:77
translate italian jamie1_c0131acd:

    # pc "Wow! Harsh!"
    pc "Wow! Che parole dure!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:80
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice "voices/jamie_009.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_009.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:81
translate italian jamie1_775544cc:

    # gnd "I'm sorry! I didn't mean anything bad by it, I just meant that you were always very charismatic and fast-talking, but never interested in studies."
    gnd "Mi dispiace! Non volevo dire niente di male, intendevo solo che sei sempre stato molto carismatico e loquace, ma mai interessato allo studio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:82
translate italian jamie1_3b20ba0b:

    # gnd "I should have said lawyer - that would have been nicer, I guess. Not that there's anything wrong with used car salesmen though."
    gnd "Avrei dovuto dire avvocato: sarebbe stato più carino, immagino. Non che ci sia nulla di male nei venditori di auto usate, però."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:83
translate italian jamie1_d28b9880:

    # pc "Well I'm a lot different than I was when I was 13."
    pc "Beh, sono molto diverso da come ero quando avevo 13 anni."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:86
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice "voices/jamie_054.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_054.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:87
translate italian jamie1_59601283:

    # gnd "Speaking of when we were 13, there was something I wanted to ask you."
    gnd "A proposito di quando avevamo 13 anni, c’era una cosa che volevo chiederti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:88
translate italian jamie1_88fa21e7:

    # pc "Ask away."
    pc "Chiedi pure."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:90
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice "voices/jamie_055.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_055.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:92
translate italian jamie1_7520d05b:

    # gnd "Why did you break up with me?"
    gnd "Perché mi hai lasciata?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:93
translate italian jamie1_7eba9d8e:

    # "My stomach does a sort of backflip. This is not what I had been expecting at all."
    "Mi si stringe lo stomaco. Non me lo sarei mai aspettato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:94
translate italian jamie1_b464fd63:

    # pc "Break up with you? What do you mean?"
    pc "Lasciarti? Cosa intendi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:97
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice "voices/jamie_056.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_056.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:98
translate italian jamie1_208f93af:

    # gnd "In middle school. We had been neighbors and friends for pretty much our whole lives."
    gnd "Alle medie. Eravamo vicini di casa e amici praticamente da sempre."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:100
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_6:

    # voice "voices/jamie_057.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_057.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:101
translate italian jamie1_03b1922c:

    # gnd "We'd play at each other's houses. You were my first kiss. You were the first boy to touch my boobs, although there wasn't much there at the time."
    gnd "Giocavamo a casa l’uno dell’altro. Sei stato il mio primo bacio. Sei stato il primo ragazzo a toccarmi il seno, anche se all’epoca non c’era granché."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:104
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_7:

    # voice "voices/jamie_058.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_058.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:105
translate italian jamie1_d37ad228:

    # gnd "We went to Homecoming together. Remember?"
    gnd "Siamo andati insieme al ballo di fine anno. Ricordi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:108
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_8:

    # voice "voices/jamie_059.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_059.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:109
translate italian jamie1_a5fe0c77:

    # gnd "Then, out of nowhere, you just stopped talking to me."
    gnd "Poi, dal nulla, hai smesso di parlarmi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:111
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_060.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_060.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:112
translate italian jamie1_a94569ad:

    # gnd "You didn't come over and see me anymore, you didn't answer my phone calls, you didn't even acknowledge me in the halls at school."
    gnd "Non venivi più a trovarmi, non rispondevi alle mie telefonate, non mi salutavi nemmeno nei corridoi della scuola."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:113
translate italian jamie1_60a987f0:

    # pc "Wait, what? I don't remember doing any of that."
    pc "Aspetta, cosa? Non ricordo di aver fatto nulla di tutto ciò."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:114
translate italian jamie1_7d86fb5a:

    # pc "We just stopped hanging out together. You had different friends and so did I."
    pc "Abbiamo semplicemente smesso di frequentarci. Tu avevi altri amici e anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:116
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_10:

    # voice "voices/jamie_061.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_061.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:117
translate italian jamie1_dc86cca2:

    # gnd "Is that what you think happened?"
    gnd "È questo che pensi sia successo?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:118
translate italian jamie1_69b6e4a8:

    # pc "From what I remember. That was a long time ago."
    pc "Da quello che ricordo. È successo tanto tempo fa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:120
translate italian jamie1_58fea4ec:

    # "She sighs and looks away from me, her bottom lip sticking out. My response obviously made her upset, but I truly don't remember things happening that way."
    "Sospira e distoglie lo sguardo da me, sporgendo il labbro inferiore. La mia risposta l’ha ovviamente turbata, ma sinceramente non ricordo che le cose siano andate così."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:121
translate italian jamie1_a62cc161:

    # "I did stop going over to her house, but that was just because we stopped hanging out as much."
    "Ho smesso di andare a casa sua, ma solo perché avevamo smesso di vederci così spesso."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:122
translate italian jamie1_3ad28c2d:

    # "I might have ignored some of her phone calls, but I don't think it was intentional. I was just doing other things and it slipped my mind."
    "Potrei aver ignorato alcune delle sue telefonate, ma non credo fosse intenzionale. Stavo semplicemente facendo altre cose e mi è sfuggito di mente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:123
translate italian jamie1_7e6fa894:

    # "And I didn't greet everybody I knew in the halls every time we passed - that's just silly."
    "E non salutavo tutti quelli che conoscevo nei corridoi ogni volta che ci incrociavamo: sarebbe semplicemente ridicolo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:124
translate italian jamie1_515956f7:

    # "But there is something else. I do remember being upset at her about something. Maybe I did consciously ignore her?"
    "Ma c’è qualcos’altro. Ricordo bene di essermi arrabbiato con lei per qualcosa. Forse l’ho ignorata consapevolmente?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:127
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_11:

    # voice "voices/jamie_062.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_062.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:128
translate italian jamie1_dce96005:

    # gnd "It wasn't just the normal growing apart. Something happened, and you just cut me off completely."
    gnd "Non era solo il normale allontanamento che si verifica con la crescita. È successo qualcosa e tu mi hai semplicemente tagliato fuori completamente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:130
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_12:

    # voice "voices/jamie_063.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_063.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:131
translate italian jamie1_98593801:

    # gnd "Every time I tried to ask you why, you blew me off, until eventually I just got the hint that you didn't like me anymore."
    gnd "Ogni volta che provavo a chiederti perché, mi liquidavi, finché alla fine ho capito che non ti piacevo più."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:132
translate italian jamie1_306adf54:

    # pc "I didn't stop liking--"
    pc "Non ho smesso di provare qualcosa per te..."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:134
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_13:

    # voice "voices/jamie_064.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_064.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:135
translate italian jamie1_02d938ef:

    # gnd "It was right after that Homecoming dance. We had a good time there. I know we did."
    gnd "È successo subito dopo quel ballo di fine anno. Ci siamo divertiti lì. Lo so che è così."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:137
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_14:

    # voice "voices/jamie_065.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_065.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:138
translate italian jamie1_b0be8140:

    # gnd "We danced like middle school kids, just holding each other and swaying back and forth."
    gnd "Abbiamo ballato come ragazzini delle medie, tenendoci semplicemente abbracciati e dondolandoci avanti e indietro."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:140
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_15:

    # voice "voices/jamie_066.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_066.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:141
translate italian jamie1_7107383b:

    # gnd "Then we snuck off to the corner and made out for the rest of the night."
    gnd "Poi ci siamo sgattaiolati in un angolo e ci siamo baciati per il resto della serata."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:143
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_16:

    # voice "voices/jamie_067.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_067.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:144
translate italian jamie1_6e0d44b1:

    # gnd "Afterwards, I thought I did something wrong. That you didn't like kissing me or something. That I had made you mad."
    gnd "Dopo, ho pensato di aver fatto qualcosa di sbagliato. Che non ti piacesse baciarmi o qualcosa del genere. Che ti avessi fatto arrabbiare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:146
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_17:

    # voice "voices/jamie_068.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_068.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:147
translate italian jamie1_ae5a2abe:

    # gnd "So what was it? What happened?"
    gnd "Allora, cos’è successo?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:148
translate italian jamie1_820e82ce:

    # pc "Homecoming? That was 8th grade?"
    pc "Il ballo di fine anno? Era in terza media?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:149
translate italian jamie1_5c9ff614:

    # "She nods."
    "Lei annuisce."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:150
translate italian jamie1_dab6ae1d:

    # pc "Ugh. I remember now."
    pc "Uff. Ora mi ricordo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:152
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_18:

    # voice "voices/jamie_069.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_069.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:153
translate italian jamie1_27030523:

    # gnd "Oh really?"
    gnd "Oh, davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:154
translate italian jamie1_791da015:

    # pc "Do you remember my friend Tosh?"
    pc "Ti ricordi il mio amico Tosh?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:156
translate italian jamie1_3b8202ee:

    # "She nods again."
    "Lei annuisce di nuovo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:157
translate italian jamie1_35a1b275:

    # pc "Well we were best friends at the time. We rode bikes everywhere and played video games together."
    pc "Beh, all’epoca eravamo migliori amici. Andavamo in bici ovunque e giocavamo ai videogiochi insieme."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:159
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_19:

    # voice "voices/jamie_070.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_070.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:160
translate italian jamie1_5dcba36c:

    # gnd "I remember. You kind of stopped hanging out with me as much once he started coming around."
    gnd "Me lo ricordo. Hai smesso un po’ di frequentarmi da quando lui ha iniziato a farsi vedere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:161
translate italian jamie1_d2697e62:

    # pc "Yeah, well after the Homecoming dance, he told me that he heard you saying stuff in the Spanish class that you shared with him."
    pc "Sì, beh, dopo il ballo di fine anno, mi ha detto che ti aveva sentito dire delle cose durante la lezione di spagnolo che frequentavi con lui."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:162
translate italian jamie1_09200a36:

    # pc "Stuff like that you didn't really like me and that you only went to the dance with me because I gave you chocolates and flowers and stuff."
    pc "Cose del tipo che in realtà non ti piacevo e che sei venuta al ballo con me solo perché ti avevo regalato cioccolatini, fiori e roba del genere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:165
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_20:

    # voice "voices/jamie_071.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_071.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:166
translate italian jamie1_9a75f2cb:

    # gnd "That's ridiculous! I never said anything like that!"
    gnd "È ridicolo! Non ho mai detto niente del genere!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:167
translate italian jamie1_358eaba7:

    # pc "I believe you!"
    pc "Ti credo!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:168
translate italian jamie1_9638be50:

    # pc "But at the time, I thought that Tosh was completely honest, and I trusted everything he said."
    pc "Ma all’epoca pensavo che Tosh fosse completamente sincero e mi fidavo di tutto quello che diceva."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:169
translate italian jamie1_89d02a73:

    # pc "It wasn't until high school that I realized that he was completely full of shit."
    pc "È stato solo al liceo che ho capito che era un gran bugiardo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:170
translate italian jamie1_b50f91a5:

    # pc "I think he's in jail now."
    pc "Credo che adesso sia in prigione."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:173
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_21:

    # voice "voices/jamie_072.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_072.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:174
translate italian jamie1_11f27db5:

    # gnd "So that's it? We were friends our whole lives, but you trusted some new guy friend from school and didn't even talk to me about it? Didn't even let me defend myself?"
    gnd "Quindi è così? Siamo stati amici per tutta la vita, ma ti sei fidata di un nuovo compagno di scuola e non me ne hai nemmeno parlato? Non mi hai nemmeno lasciato difendermi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:178
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_22:

    # voice "voices/jamie_073.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_073.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:179
translate italian jamie1_4975276b:

    # gnd "Hell yes, you were."
    gnd "Certo che sì, lo facevi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:182
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_23:

    # voice "voices/jamie_074.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_074.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:183
translate italian jamie1_4e3ae829:

    # gnd "What does it matter?"
    gnd "Che importanza ha?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:185
translate italian jamie1_9872e61d:

    # "She looks at me, tears pooling in her eyes."
    "Mi guarda, con le lacrime che le riempiono gli occhi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:187
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_24:

    # voice "voices/jamie_075.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_075.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:188
translate italian jamie1_1692a6fc:

    # gnd "You broke my heart. I know it's all middle school stuff, but you'd be surprised how much things that happen during that time in your life affect your mindset."
    gnd "Mi hai spezzato il cuore. So che sono solo cose da scuola media, ma ti stupiresti di quanto le cose che succedono in quel periodo della tua vita influenzino il tuo modo di pensare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:190
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_25:

    # voice "voices/jamie_076.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_076.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:191
translate italian jamie1_76ad11a6:

    # gnd "I was so in love with you, you wouldn't believe it."
    gnd "Ero così innamorata di te, non ci crederesti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:193
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_26:

    # voice "voices/jamie_077.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_077.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:194
translate italian jamie1_e649708c:

    # gnd "You cutting me off like that sort of flipped a switch in my brain."
    gnd "Il fatto che tu mi abbia tagliata fuori in quel modo è stato come premere un interruttore nel mio cervello."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:196
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_27:

    # voice "voices/jamie_078.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_078.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:197
translate italian jamie1_42cafbea:

    # gnd "I shut down for a long time. I didn't trust people, didn't make friends easily."
    gnd "Mi sono chiusa in me stessa per molto tempo. Non mi fidavo delle persone, non facevo amicizia facilmente."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:199
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_28:

    # voice "voices/jamie_079.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_079.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:200
translate italian jamie1_58eb925b:

    # gnd "I mostly just laid in my room and studied and cried."
    gnd "Per lo più me ne stavo sdraiata nella mia stanza a studiare e a piangere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:202
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_29:

    # voice "voices/jamie_080.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_080.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:203
translate italian jamie1_f2e0045e:

    # gnd "That's why my dad hates you. He saw what you did to me and he's never forgiven you for it."
    gnd "Ecco perché mio padre ti odia. Ha visto cosa mi hai fatto e non ti ha mai perdonato per questo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:206
translate italian jamie1_10be1c3b:

    # pc "I'm so sorry. I was a stupid kid, but that's no excuse."
    pc "Mi dispiace tantissimo. Ero una ragazzina stupida, ma non è una scusa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:207
translate italian jamie1_bcb802d4:

    # pc "I should have never treated you like that."
    pc "Non avrei mai dovuto trattarti così."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:209
translate italian jamie1_76abefbc:

    # pc "I'm not going to apologize for stuff I did when I was 13 years old. I was a stupid kid. All kids are stupid kids."
    pc "Non ho intenzione di scusarmi per le cose che ho fatto quando avevo 13 anni. Ero un ragazzino stupido. Tutti i ragazzini sono stupidi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:212
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_30:

    # voice "voices/jamie_081.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_081.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:213
translate italian jamie1_326ba1f0:

    # gnd "You're STILL a stupid kid! I'm done here! This was a mistake! We're not friends, don't talk to me anymore!"
    gnd "Sei ANCORA un ragazzino stupido! Ne ho abbastanza! È stato un errore! Non siamo amici, non parlarmi più!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:214
translate italian jamie1_6ca9d573:

    # "With that, she stands up and walks out of the café."
    "Detto questo, si alza e esce dal bar."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:215
translate italian jamie1_01c3f816:

    # "Others avert their gaze from me, trying to pretend that they hadn't heard what just happened."
    "Gli altri distolgono lo sguardo da me, cercando di fingere di non aver sentito quello che è appena successo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:216
translate italian jamie1_f5d0b218:

    # "This had not gone anything like what I had wanted. I'm not sure if my relationship with Jamie is even salvageable now."
    "Non era andata affatto come avrei voluto. Non so nemmeno se il mio rapporto con Jamie sia ancora recuperabile."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:217
translate italian jamie1_a686ffdc:

    # "I finish up my coffee, thinking about the mistakes I'd made, then I head back out to the car and go to school."
    "Finisco il mio caffè, pensando agli errori che ho commesso, poi torno alla macchina e vado a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:223
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_31:

    # voice "voices/jamie_082.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_082.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:224
translate italian jamie1_4d43b439:

    # gnd "You have no idea how long I've dreamed about hearing you say that."
    gnd "Non hai idea da quanto tempo sogno di sentirti dire questo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:226
translate italian jamie1_b94d1a33:

    # "She takes a deep breath, then reaches across the table and puts her hands on top of mine."
    "Lei fa un respiro profondo, poi allunga le mani sul tavolo e le posa sulle mie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:229
translate italian jamie1_d41d8cd9_32:

    # voice "voices/jamie_083.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_083.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:230
translate italian jamie1_fa010ee6:

    # gnd "I forgive you."
    gnd "Ti perdono."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:231
translate italian jamie1_521ec7fb:

    # pc "Thank you. I want to be friends again. Can we start over?"
    pc "Grazie. Voglio che torniamo ad essere amici. Possiamo ricominciare da capo?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:233
translate italian jamie1_07ca4578:

    # gnd "I don't think there's such a thing as starting over, but we can start working on repairing the damage."
    gnd "Non credo che esista una cosa del genere, ma possiamo iniziare a lavorare per riparare il danno."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:235
translate italian jamie1_88df1b89:

    # gnd "This helped a lot."
    gnd "Questo mi ha aiutato molto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:236
translate italian jamie1_ab6c009b:

    # pc "I'm glad. We should do it again."
    pc "Ne sono felice. Dovremmo rifarlo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:237
translate italian jamie1_241ea26c:

    # gnd "Definitely. With hopefully less crying."
    gnd "Assolutamente. Sperando che ci siano meno lacrime."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:238
translate italian jamie1_c8d9b24c:

    # "We finish up our coffees and walk out to the cars together."
    "Finiamo i nostri caffè e usciamo insieme verso le auto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:241
translate italian jamie1_1b15168b:

    # gnd "Text me sometime, we can go get coffee again or something."
    gnd "Mandami un messaggio qualche volta, possiamo andare a prendere un caffè insieme o qualcosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:242
translate italian jamie1_9b5f710f:

    # pc "I will, I promise."
    pc "Lo farò, te lo prometto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:244
translate italian jamie1_d311130c:

    # gnd "Thanks for this."
    gnd "Grazie per tutto questo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:245
translate italian jamie1_ca03cbd8:

    # pc "No, I should be thanking you for giving me another chance."
    pc "No, dovrei essere io a ringraziarti per avermi dato un’altra possibilità."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:246
translate italian jamie1_861e750f:

    # pc "I'm not going to hurt you again, I promise. I'm not the same person I was then."
    pc "Non ti farò più del male, te lo prometto. Non sono più la stessa persona di allora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:247
translate italian jamie1_18b10010:

    # gnd "I know. I can tell."
    gnd "Lo so. Si vede."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:249
translate italian jamie1_1c4e0503:

    # gnd "I'll see you later."
    gnd "Ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:250
translate italian jamie1_d22c868b:

    # "She gets into her car and drives away, back towards her house."
    "Sale in macchina e se ne va, tornando verso casa sua."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:252
translate italian jamie1_3aaaf55b:

    # "The coffee date hadn't gone anything like I expected it too, but I am still happy with the outcome."
    "L’appuntamento per il caffè non è andato affatto come me lo aspettavo, ma sono comunque contento di come è andata a finire."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:253
translate italian jamie1_d14d202f:

    # "Now that everything is out in the open, It feels like I have a real connection with Jamie."
    "Ora che tutto è venuto alla luce, mi sembra di avere un vero legame con Jamie."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:254
translate italian jamie1_1cc92515:

    # "I want to treat her right and earn her forgiveness."
    "Voglio trattarla bene e guadagnarmi il suo perdono."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:255
translate italian jamie1_26a71157:

    # "If anything else comes after that, great, but I don't expect it. Not after the way I had treated her."
    "Se dopo ci sarà qualcos’altro, benissimo, ma non me lo aspetto. Non dopo come l’ho trattata."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/jamie1.rpy:256
translate italian jamie1_86fdd457:

    # "I get into the car and drive away."
    "Salgo in macchina e me ne vado."

